Comment #7 addressed in 52970fe:

**Sticky nav may stop sticking** — Moved the safe-area offset from inline `style={{ top: "env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px)" }}` to a CSS class `.nav-sticky` with a proper fallback chain:
```css
.nav-sticky {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  top: env(safe-area-inset-top);
}
```
Browsers that don't support `env()` ignore the second declaration and use `top: 0`, keeping sticky positioning intact.

